sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant NLB as NLB
    participant TG as Target Group
    participant EC2 as EC2 Instance

    Client->>NLB: TCP Connection (L4 / TCP)
    NLB->>TG: Forward TCP traffic
    TG->>EC2: Deliver packets
    EC2->>TG: TCP Response
    TG->>NLB: Return response
    NLB->>Client: TCP Response (L4 / TCP)
